   "claim": "With the arbiter at 3e-4, every other bond at the lane's 0.01 and a commitment of 15,000 updates, the lane's bond noise (1e-3) has repaired at least 0.1 more of the damaged patch's anchored cells by T* (6.5 h) than noise scaled to 3e-5, and a signal arriving at T* loses at least 0.02 more of a 4 x 4 memory repair against a prompt one, on average",
